64/Tosakatchi_Channel_Artwork_Pose2.png/revision/latest?cb=20181019174831","caption":"Иллюстрация · Тосакатчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tosakatchi_Channel_Artwork_Pose3.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/72/Tosakatchi_Channel_Artwork_Pose3.png/revision/latest?cb=20181019174853","caption":"Иллюстрация · Тосакатчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Egg_crowders.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c4/Egg_crowders.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20211123084818","caption":"Из альбома «Тосакатчи» · № 9","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c4/Egg_crowders.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20211123084818"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Let%27s_go_eng_title.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/be/Let%27s_go_eng_title.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20140907162808","caption":"Из альбома «Тосакатчи» · № 10","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/be/Let%27s_go_eng_title.png/revision/latest?cb=20140907162808"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tosakatchi_and_band.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/5b/Tosakatchi_and_band.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20140630154827","caption":"Тосакатчи поёт в аниме.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/5b/Tosakatchi_and_band.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140630154827"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Togetchi_and_band_members.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/1e/Togetchi_and_band_members.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141129042232","caption":"На изображении · Тогэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/1e/Togetchi_and_band_members.png/revision/latest?cb=20141129042232"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:HSU_JollySeed2.PNG",