осакатчи Джунджина.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/07/Start40.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181019142440"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:G3385347.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/34/G3385347.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181019150721","caption":"Тосакатчи Кулинария.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/34/G3385347.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181019150721"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Akiiro84.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/47/Akiiro84.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181020002504","caption":"Доктор Тосакатчи.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/47/Akiiro84.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181020002504"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:PlanePlan.jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a1/PlanePlan.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221027044134","caption":"План самолета.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a1/PlanePlan.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20221027044134"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg918699.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/14/Gg918699.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194533","caption":"Тосакатчи в зимнем королевском стиле.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/14/Gg918699.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194533"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg918790.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/31/Gg918790.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924194636","caption":"Тосакатчи в зимнем королевском стиле.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/31/Gg918790.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924194636"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gg918968.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/59/Gg918968.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230924195014","caption":"Одежда Тосакатчи Чонсам.","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/59/Gg918968.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230924195014"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TMGC01-016.jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9c/TMGC01-016.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20251009002702","caption":"Tamagotchi Paradise Happy Карточка коллекции 016","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9c/TMGC01-016.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251009002702"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TosakatchiCloseupConnection.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/ab/TosakatchiCloseupConnection.gif/revision/latest?cb=20260427162409","caption":"Крупный план (Энтама для Music Star)"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TosakatchiBroomSmartSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0c/TosakatchiBroomSmartSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20221206040636","caption":"Анимация предмета «Чистящее оборудование» (умная)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tosakatchi_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a8/Tosakatchi_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20140811192331","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Тосакатчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tosakatchi2.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/25/Tosakatchi2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221213063848","caption":"На изображении · Тосакатчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/25/Tosakatchi2.png/revision/latest?cb=20221213063848"}],"related":[{"id":"chou-jinsei-enjoi-tamagotchi-plus-7ac1c9","title":"Chou Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus","ru":"Chou Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus","kind":"device","note":""